# Keep source line endings stable across Windows, macOS and Linux checkouts.
# Without this, git on Windows rewrites LF to CRLF on checkout, which shows up
# as a whole-file diff the first time anyone commits from another platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated, and one 2 MB line. Rendering a diff for it helps nobody.
data/cities.js -diff linguist-generated=true

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
